{
  "info": {
    "name": "Aruna API",
    "description": "API collection for the Aruna project.\n\nNOTE: All responses (except `/api/discussions` and `/api/cron/*`) are XOR-obfuscated and wrapped under the key `payload`. The responses documented here show the decoded structure.",
